<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel 1996 net up slightly.</title>
<headline>San Miguel 1996 net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					 (in billion pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996		1995</p>
<p>    Sales				    85		  76.6</p>
<p>    Net Income			     6.09		5.84</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)	 2.97		2.85</p>
<p>    Net less extraordinaries	   5.26		5.38</p>
<p>    EPS less extraordinaries (pesos) 2.57		2.62</p>
<p>Note: San Miguel Corp is the Philippines'</p>
<p>largest beer manufacturer. It also has interests in liquor, soft drinks, foods and packaging.</p>
</text>
